AVI-Bench Dual License
======================

This repository contains TWO distinct licensed components.

  (A) CODE  -- all source files (Python, shell, HTML, CSS, JavaScript,
      LaTeX, configuration) is licensed under the MIT License,
      reproduced in Section A below.

  (B) DATASET -- the AVI-Bench dataset and the AVI-Bench-PriSe
      extension (including all annotations, splits, JSON metadata,
      bounding-box files, processed media, and any derived
      representations distributed under those names), hosted on
      Hugging Face at
        https://huggingface.co/datasets/FudanCVL/AVIBench
      is NOT covered by the MIT License. The dataset is licensed under
      the AVI-Bench Data Use Policy v1.0 (DATA_USE_POLICY.md).

The dataset license explicitly PROHIBITS use of the dataset, in whole
or in part, to train, fine-tune, distill, align, or otherwise update
any machine-learning model, including but not limited to large
language models, vision-language models, audio-language models,
audio-visual or omni-modal foundation models, diffusion models, and
any future class of machine-learning model. See DATA_USE_POLICY.md
for the full terms.

