Section B -- AVI-Bench Data Use Policy v1.0 (summary; full text in
                                              DATA_USE_POLICY.md)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The AVI-Bench Data Use Policy v1.0 is

    Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International
    (CC BY-ND 4.0)

with a binding Anti-Training Addendum that prohibits any use of the
dataset for the training, fine-tuning, distillation, alignment, or
parameter update of any machine-learning model. Commercial use of
the dataset for evaluation and benchmarking is permitted, subject to
the Anti-Training Addendum.

By downloading, accessing, or otherwise using the dataset, you accept
DATA_USE_POLICY.md in its entirety.
